It sounds like you are covering the area well.
No special code is needed for a single occasion. The only issue is how to represent your transects - as transects in the 'secr' sense (see secr-polygondetectors.pdf <https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-polygondetectors.pdf>) or as lots of pixels in linear formation. The latter is a good compromise - easier to fit models - and may be derived from transects with discretize().

